  "docTitle": "Document Upload & Async Processing - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a document upload and processing system (KYC, invoices, claims): pre-signed uploads, metadata DB, queue and async workers, job state machine, retries with backoff and DLQ, idempotency, a slow 2-3 s third-party validator, tracking links and event-driven notifications.",
  "hero": {
