    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">JPMorgan</span><span class=\"chip company\">Acko</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Document Upload &amp; Async Processing</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn the most reusable pattern in backend interviews: accept a file fast, hand back a tracking link, and do the slow work (scanning, extraction, a 2-3 second third-party check) in the background with queues, retries, a dead-letter queue and idempotent workers - asked at Amazon SDE-2, JPMorgan and Acko SDE-1.</p>\n      "
